<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich March inflation falls to 0.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zurich March inflation falls to 0.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss consumer prices fell 0.2 percent in March from the previous month for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.4 percent, the city's statistics office said.</p>
<p>				    Mar 1997     Feb 1997	Mar 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change  -0.2 pct	0.1 pct	 0.2 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		0.4 pct	0.8 pct	 0.8 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	 103.3	  103.5	   102.9</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
